  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MHPSS Yemen &#x2013;MHPSS Expert with WHO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of WHO&#x2019;s commitment to strengthening mental health and psychosocial support services (MHPSS) in Yemen, the WorldHealth Organization (WHO) seeks the Netherlands Enterprise Agencies (RVO&#x2019;s) support for the deployment of an mental health and psychosocial support (MHPSS) expert. This expertise will be instrumental in facilitating the establishment and structuring of a dedicated MHPSS Technical Working Group (TWG), with WHO serving as the hosting organisation.The objective of this initiative is to establish a coordination mechanism among key stakeholders, ensure better integration of MHPSS approaches within national public health and humanitarian policies, and support the development of standards and operating procedures tailored to the Ivorian context. Through this support, the project partners also aim to foster experience sharing, strengthen capacity-building efforts, and improve monitoring and evaluation mechanisms for MHPSS interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
